<Base title="Part-Time Event Host | Four Dogs Entertainment" description="Learn about expressing interest in part-time Four Dogs trivia, Music Bingo, and interactive event host work across the Midlands."><section class="section dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Join the Four Dogs host team</p><h1>Can you make a room feel comfortable, confident, and ready to play?</h1><p class="lead">Four Dogs is accepting interest from part-time event hosts for trivia, Music Bingo, and interactive nights across the Midlands.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:dj.joeyelledge@gmail.com?subject=Four%20Dogs%20Host%20Interest">Send your interest</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><h2>Part-time Event Host</h2><p>A public-facing role for someone warm, clear, prepared, and steady when a room gets loud.</p><p><strong>Where:</strong> Lexington, Columbia, and nearby Midlands venues<br><strong>When:</strong> Mostly weeknights, with occasional private events<br><strong>Compensation:</strong> Paid per event, with training before independent hosting</p><h3>What matters</h3><ul><li>Dependability and presence</li><li>Comfort speaking to a room</li><li>Reliable transportation and weeknight availability</li><li>Comfort with basic event technology</li><li>At least 21 years old because many events are hosted in bars</li></ul></div><img src="/images/host.jpg" alt="A Four Dogs Entertainment event host"></div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="container"><h2>Send a short, human introduction.</h2><p>Include where you live, weeknight availability, relevant hosting or customer-facing experience, and why you would be good at helping a room have a Doggone Good Time.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:dj.joeyelledge@gmail.com?subject=Four%20Dogs%20Host%20Interest&amp;body=Name%3A%0ALocation%3A%0AWeeknight%20availability%3A%0ARelevant%20experience%3A%0AWhy%20I%20would%20be%20a%20good%20Four%20Dogs%20host%3A">Email your interest</a></div></section></Base>
